            <ArticleTitle>Hepatic cytolysis and bicytopenia after 15 days of four-drug tuberculosis treatment in Senegal.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>233-234</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1684/mst.2017.0714</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report the case of a 31-year-old immunocompetent woman residing in Senegal, with localized microscopy-proved pulmonary tuberculosis, complicated by macrophage activation syndrome and associated with viral hepatitis B, identified due to hepatic cytolysis and a bicytopenia.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
